{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "my02kif0cvibkut6", "title": "58.基于LangGraph开发智能收集小助手", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"uc4b5dd8e\" id=\"uc4b5dd8e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf4500da3\" id=\"uf4500da3\">示例代码</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0b0c1578\" id=\"u0b0c1578\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"file\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fattachments%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fppt%2F1387387%2F1745159928586-78652ee3-f780-4b44-9df8-2dd2d778a0f7.ppt%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22langgraph-collect.ppt%22%2C%22size%22%3A25152%2C%22ext%22%3A%22ppt%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22%22%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22download%22%3Atrue%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u87ff0897-b65d-4044-985b-a24790dbe92%22%2C%22taskType%22%3A%22upload%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22application%2Fvnd.ms-powerpoint%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u85c16730%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2a34d5f0\" id=\"u2a34d5f0\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"u9eed3d13\" id=\"u9eed3d13\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\">注：将ppt后缀名改为zip后解压</span></em></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9d0f9788\" id=\"u9d0f9788\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5b6ccf17\" id=\"u5b6ccf17\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">python版本：3.12.4</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc6517316\" id=\"uc6517316\"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"lATrc\" id=\"lATrc\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaf09c7e0\" id=\"uaf09c7e0\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">需求智能收集助手</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ub980fc24\" id=\"ub980fc24\"><span data-lake-id=\"u967ed3e5\" id=\"u967ed3e5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">在这个例子中，我们将创建一个帮助用户生成提示的聊天机器人。它将首先从用户那里收集需求，然后生成提示（并根据用户输入进行细化）。这些被分成两个独立的状态，LLM 决定何时在它们之间转换。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7075c301\" id=\"u7075c301\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf2dfd439\" id=\"uf2dfd439\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">下面的图表显示了该系统的图形表示。</span></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"gq2a2\" id=\"gq2a2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4c6e500a\" id=\"u4c6e500a\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">收集信息</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u43943440\" id=\"u43943440\"><span data-lake-id=\"udf2409ed\" id=\"udf2409ed\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">首先，让我们定义图中用于收集用户需求的部分。这将是一个带有特定系统消息的 LLM 调用。它将访问一个工具，当它准备好生成提示时可以调用该工具。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20typing%20import%20List%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20langchain_core.messages%20import%20SystemMessage%5Cnfrom%20langchain_core.pydantic_v1%20import%20BaseModel%5Cnfrom%20langchain_openai%20import%20ChatOpenAI%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Vp0Ny%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E6%8C%87%E5%AF%BC%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%E6%89%80%E9%9C%80%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%5Cntemplate%20%3D%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22Your%20job%20is%20to%20get%20information%20from%20a%20user%20about%20what%20type%20of%20prompt%20template%20they%20want%20to%20create.%5Cn%5CnYou%20should%20get%20the%20following%20information%20from%20them%3A%5Cn%5Cn-%20What%20the%20objective%20of%20the%20prompt%20is%5Cn-%20What%20variables%20will%20be%20passed%20into%20the%20prompt%20template%5Cn-%20Any%20constraints%20for%20what%20the%20output%20should%20NOT%20do%5Cn-%20Any%20requirements%20that%20the%20output%20MUST%20adhere%20to%5CnIf%20you%20are%20not%20able%20to%20discern%20this%20info%2C%20ask%20them%20to%20clarify!%20Do%20not%20attempt%20to%20wildly%20guess.%5CnAfter%20you%20are%20able%20to%20discern%20all%20the%20information%2C%20call%20the%20relevant%20tool.%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E5%B0%86%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E5%92%8C%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E7%BB%84%E5%90%88%E6%88%90%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%5Cndef%20get_messages_info(messages)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20%5BSystemMessage(content%3Dtemplate)%5D%20%2B%20messages%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%E7%9A%84%E6%8C%87%E4%BB%A4%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%5Cnclass%20PromptInstructions(BaseModel)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22Instructions%20on%20how%20to%20prompt%20the%20LLM.%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20objective%3A%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20variables%3A%20List%5Bstr%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20constraints%3A%20List%5Bstr%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20requirements%3A%20List%5Bstr%5D%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%20ChatOpenAI%20%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%8C%E6%B8%A9%E5%BA%A6%E8%AE%BE%E4%B8%BA%200%5Cnllm%20%3D%20ChatOpenAI(temperature%3D0)%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%B0%86%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E7%BB%91%E5%AE%9A%E5%88%B0%20LLM%20%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B%E4%B8%8A%5Cnllm_with_tool%20%3D%20llm.bind_tools(%5BPromptInstructions%5D)%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%B0%86%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E9%93%BE%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%B8%BA%20get_messages_info%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%92%8C%E7%BB%91%E5%AE%9A%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E7%9A%84%20LLM%20%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B%5Cnchain%20%3D%20get_messages_info%20%7C%20llm_with_tool%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YglCR%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h4 data-lake-id=\"uTdpK\" id=\"uTdpK\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue7f36f99\" id=\"ue7f36f99\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">生成提示</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u87f1b98b\" id=\"u87f1b98b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u986c3a18\" id=\"u986c3a18\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">现在，我们设置一个生成提示的状态。这将需要一个单独的系统消息，以及一个函数来过滤掉在工具调用之前的所有消息（因为那是上一个状态决定是时候生成提示的时候）。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20langchain_core.messages%20import%20AIMessage%2C%20HumanMessage%2C%20ToolMessage%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%5Cnprompt_system%20%3D%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22Based%20on%20the%20following%20requirements%2C%20write%20a%20good%20prompt%20template%3A%5Cn%5Cn%7Breqs%7D%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%E6%89%80%E9%9C%80%E7%9A%84%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%5Cn%23%20%E5%8F%AA%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%5Cndef%20get_prompt_messages(messages%3A%20list)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20tool_call%20%3D%20None%5Cn%20%20%20%20other_msgs%20%3D%20%5B%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20for%20m%20in%20messages%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20isinstance(m%2C%20AIMessage)%20and%20m.tool_calls%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20tool_call%20%3D%20m.tool_calls%5B0%5D%5B%5C%22args%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20elif%20isinstance(m%2C%20ToolMessage)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20continue%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20elif%20tool_call%20is%20not%20None%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20other_msgs.append(m)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20%5BSystemMessage(content%3Dprompt_system.format(reqs%3Dtool_call))%5D%20%2B%20other_msgs%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%B0%86%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E9%93%BE%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%B8%BA%20get_prompt_messages%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%92%8C%20LLM%20%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B%5Cnprompt_gen_chain%20%3D%20get_prompt_messages%20%7C%20llm%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z5xRi%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h4 data-lake-id=\"sA7Cf\" id=\"sA7Cf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8744097a\" id=\"u8744097a\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">定义状态逻辑</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u1aad44d2\" id=\"u1aad44d2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3df44e3c\" id=\"u3df44e3c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">这是聊天机器人所处状态的逻辑。如果最后一条消息是工具调用，那么我们处于“提示创建者”（</span><code data-lake-id=\"ua3ec84cb\" id=\"ua3ec84cb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u59bc7c5c\" id=\"u59bc7c5c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--md-code-fg-color)\">prompt</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1f6b7f72\" id=\"u1f6b7f72\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">）应该响应的状态。否则，如果最后一条消息不是 HumanMessage，那么我们知道人类应该接下来响应，因此我们处于</span><span data-lake-id=\"u9b4fd3ad\" id=\"u9b4fd3ad\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u9fbc9431\" id=\"u9fbc9431\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0562a8c8\" id=\"u0562a8c8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--md-code-fg-color)\">END</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u74e4ab9a\" id=\"u74e4ab9a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u8f4c7e19\" id=\"u8f4c7e19\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">状态。如果最后一条消息是 HumanMessage，那么如果之前有工具调用，那么我们处于</span><span data-lake-id=\"u88a1a051\" id=\"u88a1a051\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u34c10c95\" id=\"u34c10c95\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5790b5e1\" id=\"u5790b5e1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--md-code-fg-color)\">prompt</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ucb3a9c9a\" id=\"ucb3a9c9a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u7aee7dc6\" id=\"u7aee7dc6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">状态。否则，我们处于“信息收集”（</span><code data-lake-id=\"u0c798f85\" id=\"u0c798f85\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4149296d\" id=\"u4149296d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--md-code-fg-color)\">info</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf8cdef46\" id=\"uf8cdef46\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">）状态。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20typing%20import%20Literal%5Cnfrom%20langgraph.graph%20import%20END%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E5%BD%93%E5%89%8D%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%5Cndef%20get_state(messages)%20-%3E%20Literal%5B%5C%22add_tool_message%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22info%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22__end__%5C%22%5D%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20isinstance(messages%5B-1%5D%2C%20AIMessage)%20and%20messages%5B-1%5D.tool_calls%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20%5C%22add_tool_message%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20elif%20not%20isinstance(messages%5B-1%5D%2C%20HumanMessage)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20END%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20%5C%22info%5C%22%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oCgKR%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h4 data-lake-id=\"gouVJ\" id=\"gouVJ\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue30fa72a\" id=\"ue30fa72a\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">创建图</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u9641122c\" id=\"u9641122c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7e2d47ff\" id=\"u7e2d47ff\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">现在，我们可以创建该图。我们将使用 SqliteSaver 来持久化对话历史记录。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20langgraph.checkpoint.memory%20import%20MemorySaver%5Cnfrom%20langgraph.graph%20import%20START%2C%20MessageGraph%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%20MemorySaver%20%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B%5Cnmemory%20%3D%20MemorySaver()%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%20MessageGraph%20%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B%5Cnworkflow%20%3D%20MessageGraph()%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%20%5C%22info%5C%22%20%E5%92%8C%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E9%93%BE%5Cnworkflow.add_node(%5C%22info%5C%22%2C%20chain)%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%20%5C%22prompt%5C%22%20%E5%92%8C%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E9%93%BE%5Cnworkflow.add_node(%5C%22prompt%5C%22%2C%20prompt_gen_chain)%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%5Cn%40workflow.add_node%5Cndef%20add_tool_message(state%3A%20list)%3A%5Cn%20%